The boundaries of the new Municipality of Tboli shall be as follows:
A tract of land (Municipality of Tboli) located in the province of South Cotabato which is bounded in the
West, from point 1 to 2 by the DAR settlement; bounded in the north from point 2 to 3 by the province of
Cotabato; from point 3 to 11 by the remaining area of Surallah; from point 11 to 12 by the Municipality of
Banga and portion of Tupi; bounded in the North-East and East from point 12 to 13 by the remaining area of
Tupi; from point 13 to 14 by remaining area of Polomolok; from 14 to 15 by portion of Polomolok and
General Santos City; bounded on the South from point 15 to 1 by the Municipalities of Maasim, Kiamba and
Maitum, all of South Cotabato. Beginning at a point marked "1" on plan which is identical to point "7" of the
DAR Settlement plan.
